  "description": "After his mother passed away when he was young, Jun-Young was raised by his older brother Jun-Won thanks to his father who was busy with work. The two were closer and more affectionate than any other brothers, but their relationship grew distant as Jun-Won entered puberty. The change in the relationship between brothers, which was not lacking even though they were strangers, suddenly changes along with Jun-Young's last days of high school...\n\n*\"My little brother, it's okay for me to do whatever I want, right...?\"*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
